## Marks data model (intentional split)

- **`marks`** — per-subject rows from teacher **Enter Marks** / **Manage Marks**.
- **`marks_new`** — denormalized term row (`english`, `tamil`, …) for **report cards**; admin **Marks** page.

Unifying these is a future enhancement; both are documented here.

## Retired paths

- `student/*.php` → redirect stubs to main portal
- `adminDashboard.php`, `teachersDashboard.php` → redirect to `admin/dashboard.php`, `teacher/dashboard.php`
- Root NiceAdmin `*.html` demos — not application routes
